## Y101: tab in indentation

- A list item
	- indented with a tab

## Y201: trailing backslash

A backslash at the end of a line is redundant in YAMD \
because a newline is already a line break.

## Y210: hard-wrapped paragraph

This paragraph was wrapped at 72 characters by an editor, the way many
Markdown files are written. In YAMD every line break is kept, so it renders
as four short lines instead of one paragraph. The quick fix joins the lines
into one.

## Y301: missing space after hashes

##Installation

## Y401: line after a quote

> A quote line
without a leading `>` on this line

## Y601: unknown directive

:::x-acme-chart {type=bar}
Q1: 10, Q2: 20
:::

## Y701: broken links

- Missing anchor: [see setup](#setup)
- Missing file: [[does-not-exist]]
- Missing image: ![A chart that was deleted](chart.png)
- Undefined reference: [the docs][docs]
- Undefined footnote: see note[^missing]
- Missing cross-reference: see [@fig:nothing]

